# Google reCAPTCHA v2 (comentarios do blog)
# Crie em https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin (tipo: Checkbox v2)
# Dominios: localhost + dominio de producao
CCD_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
CCD_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=

# Railway vars: terraform/ (GitHub Actions)
# Secrets: RAILWAY_API_TOKEN (ou RAILWAY_TOKEN) + WP_ADMIN_PASSWORD
#
# Migrar copia local -> Railway (seguro: tunel SSH, sem MySQL publico):
#   Ver scripts/migration/README.md
#   railway ssh keys list
#   .\scripts\migration\sync-local-to-railway.ps1
#   .\scripts\migration\sync-local-to-railway.ps1 -UseExistingDump
#   .\scripts\migration\upload-media-to-railway.ps1 -Volume wp-uploads-5g
#
# Automatico no GitHub:
#   - Codigo/temas/plugins: push na main -> Auto-deploy Railway
#   - Posts/usuarios/conteudo: so com sync do dump (sob demanda; nao a cada push)
